WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:03.310
Tony, why?

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:23.190
Tony, can you hear me? It's me, Kaido Yuji!

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:27.420
Answer me, Tony!

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:33.970
Tony, listen to what I'm saying!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:38.300
They've got the laser defense net operating.

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:43.640
That laser defense net is impeccable.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:49.310
No matter where we come in from, there's a risk of being shot down.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:53.980
Can't we swing around to the other side, Marlene?

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:56.320
Look! We can get in through here!

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:59.090
All right, we're going in!

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:26.520
This is awful.

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:39.960
I- is that...?

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.060
Victor!?

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:51.140
Su?

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:56.290
No, it isn't. That's...

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:00.320
Wait! Don't worry!

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:02.330
We're allies!

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:04.330
Allies, you say?

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:05.660
Stay back!

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:08.160
You're in league with those monsters, right!?

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:10.930
Hurry up and show your true selves!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.670
Then you can turn me into a meat dumpling like you did Victor!

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:18.000
Monsters? What are you talking about? Hey!

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:23.010
It's all over... Everyone's going to die...

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:25.950
Everything will be lost!

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:32.990
You're Lu Li Chang, from the High Council science staff, right?

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:55.970
Honestly, that was one tough door!

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:56.980
Rick!!

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:59.980
Yo! So it's you guys, huh?

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:02.990
We knew that one shuttle had punched its way in, after all.

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:06.320
What the hell has happened?

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:07.650
Su!

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:08.690
Lu!

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:24.000
I get it now...

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:30.010
Twin sisters, huh? To think they had gotten mixed in with our brigade.

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:35.310
Under orders from the High Council, Su manipulated the Sleepers' data.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:39.950
It was in order to deceive Seno, who had realized the risk of their plans.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:43.620
And this is the outcome of all that? Damn scary tale.

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:50.290
I never imagined it would turn out like this. If I'd known, I would've...

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.900
Even so, I don't think I would have been able to stop this.

00:05:53.970 --> 00:06:01.970
Victor-he believed that what we were doing was right, after all. And so, I...

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:03.980
What's going on with the Blue?

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:06.570
The sensors don't work on them.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:09.520
We can't even begin to guess where they are,

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:12.320
or even how many of them may be lurking around here.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:14.980
What about Tony?

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:19.220
In any event, right now, stopping him comes first.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:23.320
Lu, can you guess where Tony could be?

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:27.340
I'm afraid he must be in the Main Computer Room.

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:30.140
If he's serious about intending to move this station,

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:36.910
he would have to be using the Automatons to set up some kind of propulsion.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:45.280
All right, that settles it! I'm coming with you!

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:50.950
But, if, in the worst case-if we were to fail...

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:57.630
What do you think Seno is going to do to this station?

00:06:57.700 --> 00:06:59.290
Knowing him...

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:04.140
he'll have no intention of quietly committing double-suicide with Tony.

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:07.970
We can still pack more on! Bring us some more!

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:10.980
Round up the explosives from the 12th storage locker too!

00:07:11.050 --> 00:07:13.980
Start up the 4th shuttle, just in case!

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.640
More explosives!

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:18.660
Even the mining stuff and rocket warheads!

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:22.590
Hazardous range to escape collision with the medical station is at 2030.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:26.990
Hurry up, input the codes, and prepare the shuttle for launch!

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:29.830
Still no response from the battalion

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:32.200
that successfully broke into the medical station.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.380
Hey! Hold up a minute!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.400
It's awfully bad in here, too.

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:11.970
Tony... how could he mean to do something like this!?

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:16.910
His B cells have run wild. Being governed by his B cells,

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:20.310
his consciousness is no different from the Blue.

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:25.650
Thanks to you, Marlene, I was able to escape being controlled by my B cells.

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:29.660
If he's in the same state as I was then,

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:31.960
then this time I will save Tony!

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.930
However, if you are unable to stop him...

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.260
you know what, right Yuji?

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:33.580
I'm sure the Computer Room's 1st Block is supposed to be here somewhere...

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:35.590
It's built like a maze in here...

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.130
Above you, Marlene!

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:47.900
You bastard!!

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:54.610
Thank you, Marlene!

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:55.870
They're here! It's them!

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:00.980
We can't go any further! We're going back!

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:19.640
Let's run away to a Block somewhere while we can!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:22.300
Marlene! I'm diving in through that door!

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:43.380
Alicia?

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.830
Well, if it isn't Alicia.

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:26.960
- Abnormal energy emissions. Danger Level II.
- Warning: Danger of abnormality in station functions.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.970
- Outboard Automatons numbers 5 through 46 in operation
- Abnormal energy emissions. Danger Level IV.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.980
- All functions on Block A-15 have ceased. Abnormal decompression is occurring on Block F-3.
- Functions on AA Block have ceased.

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:41.180
- Emergency APU in operation. Emergency transfer, Blocks P through R.
- Issuing Danger Level V to the entire station. State of emergency.

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:07.340
Hurry up! It's closing!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:08.500
W- wait!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:17.740
Su...

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:43.650
Hurry, Lu!

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:46.650
We don't know when the Blue will break through that bulkhead on us!

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:48.980
Don't talk to me!

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:52.490
A bit longer... Just a little bit longer is all...

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:09.340
Write-protect... removed... Hurry and put on space suits with everyone else!

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:12.670
Got it!

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:13.940
Cutting loose the residential section

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:15.740
can only be done with the manual controls.

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.780
This is where the real contest begins.

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:23.010
Alicia...

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:28.530
Thank goodness! You made it through safely! What's the matter with Tony?

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:31.950
It's okay, come on over here!

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:34.620
You can go together with us!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.130
It's no good!! Watch out, Yuji!

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.130
Yuji!

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:04.320
Marlene!

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.990
Stop! What the hell is wrong with you, Alicia!?

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:13.900
It's no use... I'm afraid Alicia has lost herself to the activation of her B cells.

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:18.340
No matter what you say, our voices will not reach her.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:22.680
That can't be!

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:26.240
Hey! Look above you, Yuji and Marlene!

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:33.180
We're surrounded...

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:36.620
Marlene!

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:38.180
Goddamn it!

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:51.970
Don't stay there, come this way, Yuji.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.630
Alicia...

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:58.980
Yuji, you understand, right? Why it was that we were awakened in this era?

00:14:59.050 --> 00:15:02.990
What it is that we must do now...?

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:06.990
So, come on...

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:10.990
No... It's not right, Alicia!

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:16.500
We are different from the Blue! We're human!

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:21.660
So Alicia, please open your eyes too!

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:26.680
So... I knew it, Yuji, you like Marlene, huh?

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:31.270
That's why you say that... But I'm different.

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:37.320
I'm not going to be tricked. I'm not going to be tricked by you, Yuji.

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.910
Alicia...!

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:44.290
Yuji!!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:47.630
I'll turn Alicia back... you'll see!

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:49.290
Yuji!

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:51.960
Listen to me, Alicia.

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:55.630
You can't let the B cells control your mind.

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:58.730
I thought you would understand, Yuji.

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:03.970
Being woken up all alone in a world you knew nothing about...

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:06.950
Remember the times when you had fun!

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:10.320
Now take it back, the Earth that was ours!

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:18.320
Frightened... sad... wanting to cry, but not being allowed to cry...

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:25.670
But that person was different. That person accepted me!

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:31.610
Nobody is going to leave you alone! Stop this, Alicia!

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:36.540
At first, it was very frightening... but... but...

00:16:56.030 --> 00:17:00.300
You'll get used to them soon. There is nothing to fear.

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:05.970
You and I both are chosen messiahs for this world, after all.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:12.310
Marvelous... Let me have you listen to it as well.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:15.040
The principal, grand voice of life...

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:18.650
N- no!

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:21.320
Accept it!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:24.520
The significance of our being born, the reason we awoke,

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:30.330
the testament to our lives... it's all right in here.

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:31.960
S- stop it...

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:34.440
Accept, Alicia!

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:06.070
That's good. There is nothing to fear.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.440
We have been re-born.

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:24.320
Yes... we are... messiahs...

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:26.320
Alicia!

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:28.980
It's okay if everything...

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:31.290
...is lost...

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:34.260
Everybody... Everybody...

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:36.130
DIE!!

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:44.940
State of emergency! State of emergency!

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:50.950
An abnormality has arisen in the station's energy. State of emergency!

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:53.740
Final Judgment is about to begin...

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:19.670
An energy abnormality has arisen! An energy abnormality has arisen!

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:28.870
Marlene! Catch!

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:39.930
That's right! Everybody can just die!

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:43.920
Just die...

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.270
Die... Die...

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:49.600
Marlene, you can just die!

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:51.940
Stop it, Alicia!

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:54.670
No, let me go! You don't understand, Yuji!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:57.680
I hate you! Yuji, I really hate you!

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:10.620
Stay with us, Rick!

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:19.300
It's all right. Never mind me, there's no time. Shoot her, Marlene!

00:20:19.370 --> 00:20:20.960
Don't, Marlene!

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:22.970
You can't Marlene! Don't shoot!

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:26.440
Shoot her... Marlene...

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.270
Shoot!

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:35.920
Marlene!

00:20:35.990 --> 00:20:39.420
I don't want anyone else to have to die!

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:43.920
Yuji, just die!!

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:47.900
My beloved... Yuji...!

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:58.000
Alicia?

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:07.280
Alicia? Alicia! I- it can't be!!

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:09.650
Alicia!!

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:39.590
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:45.720
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:54.870
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:54.990 --> 00:22:01.040
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.190 --> 00:22:07.460
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:14.650
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:14.840 --> 00:22:19.810
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:19.910 --> 00:22:25.870
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:32.150
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:32.760 --> 00:22:39.630
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:39.810 --> 00:22:46.490
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:51.860 --> 00:22:54.650
Being woken up in an era I know nothing about,

00:22:54.730 --> 00:22:57.820
then being thrown into the middle of a hellish battle-

00:22:57.900 --> 00:23:00.130
what attachment do I have to this world?

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:03.790
Those rotten humans- they can all just die!

00:23:03.870 --> 00:23:10.140
Our awakening was a little too soon. I'll be here together with you.

00:23:10.210 --> 00:23:13.470
How... how can that be!?
